  },
  "evaluation": "Reuse saved first/repeat/original-graph grid reports on viewed40; new576 forwards on fresh16: two full12view runs and one serial original-graph reference per image. Score coarse4, unfiltered12, supported augmentation from exactly the same measured views. No additional model for postprocessing.",
